<footer>Rendered by <a href="https://github.com/SalamLang/Salam">Salam</a>
  <code>net/http/swagger</code> (<a id="raw">OpenAPI document</a>)
  &middot; <a href="https://www.salamlang.ir">salamlang.ir</a></footer>
